{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:242","content":{"id":242,"title":"33 如何清除病毒感染","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b3c6bd1c-450e-40f5-a498-52398e86497d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对抗病毒的整个环节："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"47eeb2e8-7193-488d-a44c-8b55da9f6716","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"47efa5a9-0456-4f06-afa7-5e3dab612890","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dedbdaf0-0e35-4e09-9725-a208d902663e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"先天性免疫系统力图遏制感染迅速扩展"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"dd58082b-8ed1-4296-bbb1-f3a494377583","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e9e14d39-8782-40ed-86df-c5008bba2e50","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"大量化学信号散发，请求调高体温"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1af5d483-0e97-4e87-a026-2bb0ed6b25da","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"aa52e513-287b-4274-adea-b9b6a6e934b5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"产生更多黏液，让人剧烈咳嗽，把病毒排出体外"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"846fbdae-4b0e-4f76-9b8e-029140f5809e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"44e45bc4-e44d-4010-ae67-3ffa55eafc0a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"自然杀伤细胞两三天后抵达战场，杀死不在现实 MHC-I 类分子的感染细胞"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"80499cf8-490b-40a4-9acc-0974db0bd26d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9dec52f9-d719-4afd-9215-1dbc385811ee","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"树突细胞对战场进行采样，放入自己的 MHC-I 类分子和 MHC-II 分子中，激活杀伤性 T 细胞和辅助性 T 细胞，辅助性 T 细胞激活 B 细胞生成抗体"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"77b3416b-5740-4974-9788-2f39f3ffd132","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9f24ff90-c2d2-4854-a407-3e241c8127d6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"杀伤性 T 细胞奔赴战场，一旦发现病毒抗原，就让感染细胞自尽，巨噬细胞再清除尸体"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c6829a08-3378-4786-9df1-bf0fe4341dd2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6ca86f30-f4a4-4889-a785-a9b926d98a17","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"千百万抗体抵达战场，清除细胞外病毒，不让感染更多细胞"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"333d1d1f-512e-46e8-aac9-d9ca05385bf9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a0a4405f-e52f-4389-b419-3f168c479eef","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"大部分病毒被消灭，关闭免疫系统，以防造成严重破坏"}]}]}]},{"type":"divide-line","tauContract":"e43f9dce629c905e0bcd68c62f974061860b4a4428d1bf3ee0965ca60e23efd0","collabId":"d415a8a5-b62f-4f5e-96a1-21661836ea34","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d8193f4f-9235-4bca-b3e7-1c6d571ab0d1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"没什么没有更高的抗病毒药，因为病毒和人体细胞太相似了。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"71aae42e-5b0a-4d88-aed1-4a16ce98ee48","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为什么细菌可以通过抗生素杀死："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"085ea7d0-602c-472d-a4c6-be7470b8d9f3","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1664c657-db06-4812-8595-3af744dc9612","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5261343f-3b29-441f-9a24-08b667b06c7f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"青霉素：阻止细胞壁的合成，因为人体细胞只有细胞膜，没有细胞壁，所以只针对细菌"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"86ee5980-8f4a-4bf2-8be4-2e4ae8d79f10","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b76b7e54-1bbd-4a90-b904-f9a17e2c9b55","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"四环素：针对细菌的核糖体，虽然人体细胞也有核糖体，但是和细菌的不同，因此四环素只抑制细菌的核糖体"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c501d61c-35ce-4218-94f0-122aa1d3f399","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是病毒和人体细胞的结构很像，在两个地方可以攻击病毒："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"827739de-e210-43f5-a6c9-3cc23ddfc817","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"eebae420-3ff7-4ce0-b287-26feeba240de","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fd454722-caf6-465d-a4e7-86d844d17110","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"细胞外：制造能和病毒受体结合的蛋白，但是因为病毒能和体细胞受体结合，这个和病毒受体结合的蛋白也会影响到人体的体细胞"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"cafcd9e0-f2be-4e97-ae6b-2ab2d7c8ec4c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0c39f897-4a9f-4bfc-a873-4c17cf81e50a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"细胞内：因为病毒使用的我们人体的细胞进行病毒的繁殖，无法生成只干扰病毒的药"}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第三部分，恶意接管"},{"label":"33 如何清除病毒感染","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:242","type":"doc","id":242}}],"prevPage":{"title":"32 天生杀手","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:238","type":"doc","id":238}},"nextPage":{"title":"34 关闭免疫应答","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:243","type":"doc","id":243}},"createTime":1741821784926,"updateTime":1743303640527,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640527}}